# `revision` is the upstream base: ml-explore/mlx-lm `main` as of 2026-09-01.
# The submodule tracks the private fork's `main`, whose history is exactly
# `revision` plus the commits mirrored as native/mlx-patches/*.patch. The
# build scripts and documentation must use this submodule, never a PyPI
# install (PyPI's mlx-lm 0.31.3 is months behind `main` and lacks the
# LRUPromptCache RAM tier this project builds on). Bump `revision` to a
# newer upstream SHA whenever our commits rebase cleanly onto it; record the
# bump in the run journal per NOW.md.
